{
  "id": "c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Slow travel and authenticity",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what is the most memorable journey you have been on?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you prefer to plan every detail of a trip or leave it open?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how has travel changed over the last few decades?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what would be your ideal way of getting to know a new country?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e22-a1",
            "c1-e22-a2",
            "c1-e22-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people experiencing places in different ways. Choose two of the pictures and say what these travellers might gain from their experiences, and how real their experience of the place might be.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 15200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these ways of travelling would you prefer?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e22-b1",
            "c1-e22-b2",
            "c1-e22-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show different ways of exploring. Choose two of the pictures and say what the attractions of these ways of travelling might be, and what the drawbacks could be.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think you can really get to know a place on a short visit?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some factors that influence how people choose to travel, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10900
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these factors affect the way people choose to explore a new place?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7700
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which has the strongest influence on travellers today?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about travel and authenticity.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent has mass tourism spoiled the places it depends on?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, is it more valuable to travel slowly and see little than to travel quickly and see a lot?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think flying should be limited for the sake of the environment?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Can a visitor ever really understand a culture that is not their own?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, how does social media change the way people choose where to go?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should popular places charge tourists more than local people?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e22-slow-travel-and-authenticity/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
